<slide>
  theme: light
</slide>

## Images

The `<img>` tag: `src` is relative to the `.slide` file; `class` and `width` / `height` size and place it.

<img src=diagram.svg alt=diagram class=small />

<code lang=text>
  <img src=diagram.svg class=left width=420px />
  <img src=photo.jpg alt="a wide photo" class=large />
</code>

<notes>
  .small .large .left .right adjust size/alignment; width= and height= set CSS sizes.
</notes>
